cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this repository, please cite the note your work relies on; both are listed
  under "references" below. Each has a version DOI (the specific deposit) and a concept
  DOI (all versions); cite the version DOI when reproducibility depends on the exact files.
title: "Record chronologies for odd/odd Diophantine approximation — reproducibility material"
abstract: >-
  Exact-arithmetic computations, certificates and data supporting two technical notes on
  chronological record minima for odd/odd rational approximation of quadratic irrationals.
authors:
